    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L09-ACTIVITY-010",
      "SourceSection": "9.3: Graphs of Cosine and Sine",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Looking at the graphs of \\(y=\\cos(\\theta)\\) and \\(y=\\sin(\\theta)\\), at what values of \\(\\theta\\) do \\(\\cos(\\theta)=\\sin(\\theta)\\)? Where on the unit circle do these points correspond to?",
